}}The '''ComMuni''' ({{IPA|bl|ˈkɑ.mjuːni}} {{respell|com|MEW|nee}}; {{Langx|mxi|كُومُونِي|Kommuni}}), is the [[W:Cooperative federation|cooperative federation]] of [[W:Public transit|public transit]] operators in the [[Castejón|Castejón Metropolis]]. It serves as a secondary transit system alongside the [[CMRT|Metropolitan Rapid Transit]] (CMRT), mainly operating within the 10 boroughs. Ridership is free, as is all public transit.

All routes are required to feature non-step buses with a kneeling function to assist mobility-impaired users.

